KG42.register("clusters-615af300310f27078879626c",{"id":"24-brooklyn_microgrid::v142-d-K001","paper":"24-brooklyn_microgrid","label":"Community access, equal access, and participant composition","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Community access, equal access, and participant composition","market_meaning":"Market setup should define the community or similar group that may participate, provide equal access to eligible participants, and include participants with generation capability. The participation permissions of consumers and prosumers jointly supplement this access arrangement; the BMG additionally specifies local and hyper-local participation categories.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The group access, equal access, and generation capability requirements in the general framework are retained in layers with the BMG participation categories. Virtual participation does not require physical connection; hyper-local is not thereby deemed to have a determined geographic boundary, and equal access is not interpreted as unconditional openness to everyone.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The three chains jointly answer who may enter the market and what roles the participant group needs to have, forming a qualitative candidate rule for access and composition. Traded products and specific offer behavior have independent decision content and are retained separately.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provide group access, equal access, and virtual participation boundaries."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Supplement the consumer participation permission and the BMG consumer category."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Supplement the prosumer participation permission and the requirement that the group have generation capability."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-e02"],"rationale":"The general access scope and the consumer role permission are complementary, and the BMG passage explicitly specifies consumer and hyper-local participation; this correspondence does not add household-by-household eligibility determination or physical connection requirements."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g03-e002"],"rationale":"Market setup simultaneously specifies the access group and the subgroup with generation capability, and the BMG category description supplements the prosumer scope; a group composition requirement does not mean that every participant must generate electricity."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g03-e001","v141-b-g03-e002"],"rationale":"The same BMG participant description lists consumers and prosumers, and the two chains supplement the role composition; this is not used to assert that the roles are mutually exclusive or to determine the number of participants in each transaction."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G01","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The current chain can express qualitative participation permission, but the operational boundaries of the community, similar group, and hyper-local, as well as the method for determining whether the number of participants is sufficient, are not provided.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R008","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g03-e002"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If household-by-household access or participant-count checks need to be implemented, upstream should obtain the group definition and determination basis; currently only category-level rules are retained, and no radius or numerical threshold is added."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G02","category":"ontology_extension","description":"The platform responsibility for equal access and the conditional single identity verification have not obtained independent graph objects. The relevant proposal remains pending; the identity consensus scheme applies only to its original trusted-community conditions and cannot become a new access obligation for all participants.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::admission.local_area","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E14","v141-b-g01-E15","v141-b-g01-E16"],"proposal_ids":["proposal:v141-b-g01-information-system","proposal:v141-b-g01-identity-verification"],"required_work":"Manually review the platform and identity verification proposal and its applicable conditions, and then decide whether C should supplement the corresponding chain; this time the platform or identity mechanism is not equated with a geographic access node."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G03","category":"unverified_source","description":"The evidence of this cluster remains unverified and has only experimental candidate-support eligibility; independent source verification has not been completed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R008","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g01-E14","v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g03-e001","v141-b-g03-e002"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequent manual checking should verify the citations, locations, and applicable scopes of the general framework and the BMG instance; assembled only means that the stated qualitative candidates have been assembled."}]},"rule_refs":["24-brooklyn_microgrid::v141-c-R001","24-brooklyn_microgrid::v141-c-R008","24-brooklyn_microgrid::v141-c-R009"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-fc2134ec5ed3e3df","KG31-58074c71e4394ab8","KG31-a09529f1c87cf09c"]});
